 {"slug": "ex02_grouping_function", "problems": [
  {"title": "부서 소계 행만", "cols": [("deptno","n"),("cnt","n")], "rows": [(10,3),(20,5),(30,6)],
   "oracle": "SELECT deptno, COUNT(*) FROM emp GROUP BY ROLLUP (deptno, job) HAVING GROUPING(job) = 1 AND GROUPING(deptno) = 0",
   "note": "GROUPING(deptno) = 0 을 빼면 총계 행(NULL, 14)도 남는다."},
  {"title": "소계·총계·실제 NULL 라벨", "cols": [("species","s"),("label","s"),("s","n")],
   "rows": [("A","x",1),("A","NULL값",3),("A","소계",4),("B","y",5),("B","소계",5),(None,"총계",9)],
   "oracle": "SELECT species, CASE WHEN GROUPING(species) = 1 THEN '총계' WHEN GROUPING(breed) = 1 THEN '소계' ELSE NVL(breed, 'NULL값') END, SUM(cnt)\nFROM ah_null GROUP BY ROLLUP (species, breed)",
   "sqlserver": "SELECT species, CASE WHEN GROUPING(species) = 1 THEN N'총계' WHEN GROUPING(breed) = 1 THEN N'소계' ELSE ISNULL(CAST(breed AS NVARCHAR(10)), N'NULL값') END, SUM(cnt)\nFROM ah_null GROUP BY ROLLUP (species, breed)",
   "note": "SQL Server 에서 ISNULL(breed, N'NULL값') 으로 쓰면 VARCHAR(5) 로 바뀌어 '??' 가 된다 → CHECK_FAIL. CAST 로 형을 먼저 넓힌다."}]},
